---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import { contact } from "../data/site";
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths";
import beanInspection from "../assets/media/bean-inspection.webp";

const whatsappUrl = `https://wa.me/${contact.whatsapp.replace(/\D/g, "")}`;
---

<BaseLayout title="Frequently Asked Questions | Sibu Trading PLC" description="Answers about Sibu Trading PLC, Ethiopian coffee origins, processing, samples and historical certification documents.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Frequently asked questions" title="Your questions, answered." description="A starting point for learning about Sibu and its coffee. Contact our team for current lot details and buyer enquiries." image={beanInspection} alt="Person inspecting a green coffee bean" />

  <section class="section section--cream" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="shell faq-layout">
      <div class="faq-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Good to know</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-title">Clear answers. Direct conversations.</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">For current availability and lot-specific information, speak with Sibu directly.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={withBase("/contact/")}>Contact Sibu</a>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span class="faq-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span>What does Sibu Trading PLC do?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Sibu Trading PLC is an Ethiopian green coffee company established in 2014. Its family coffee story began in Guji and spans three generations.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span class="faq-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span>Which Ethiopian origins does Sibu work with?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>The site features Guji and Kercha, Hambella Wamena, Gelana and Abaya, and selected coffees from Yirgacheffe and Lemo. Ask Sibu which origins and lots are currently available.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span class="faq-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span>Which coffee preparations are described?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Sibu describes natural and washed coffees, selected honey preparations, and specialty lots separated by origin, process and quality potential. The team can confirm the process and availability of a specific lot.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span class="faq-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span>How can I request samples?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Use the <a href={withBase("/contact/")}>enquiry form</a> or <a href={whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp Sibu</a>. Share the origin, process, preparation and approximate volume you need. The team will confirm availability and next steps.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span class="faq-number" aria-hidden="true">05</span><span>Are the certificates shown on the website current?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>The <a href={withBase("/recognition/")}>Recognition archive</a> includes dated historical documents. Expired certificates do not establish current certification. Confirm status and lot eligibility with Sibu for the relevant crop year, farm or station, lot and destination market.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary><span class="faq-number" aria-hidden="true">06</span><span>Where can I learn more about the company?</span><span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Read <a href={withBase("/our-story/")}>Sibu’s story</a> or <a href={withBase("/Sibu-Trading-PLC-Company-Profile.pdf")} download>download the company profile (PDF)</a>. For current operating figures, contact Sibu directly.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .faq-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .faq-intro {
    position: sticky;
    top: 8rem;
  }

  .faq-intro .text-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .faq-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .faq-item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .faq-item summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.5rem minmax(0, 1fr) 1.5rem;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    color: var(--coffee);
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 1.65vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-number,
  .faq-toggle {
    color: var(--gold-text);
  }

  .faq-number {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .faq-toggle {
    justify-self: end;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: transform 180ms ease;
  }

  .faq-item[open] .faq-toggle {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .faq-answer {
    padding: 0 2.5rem 1.6rem 3.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .faq-answer a {
    color: var(--forest);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .faq-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .faq-intro {
      position: static;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .faq-item summary {
      grid-template-columns: 1.7rem minmax(0, 1fr) 1.25rem;
      gap: 0.65rem;
    }

    .faq-answer {
      padding-right: 0.5rem;
      padding-left: 2.35rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .faq-toggle {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
